{"id":35062,"mal_id":35062,"title":"Mahoutsukai no Yome","englishTitle":"The Ancient Magus' Bride","title_english":"The Ancient Magus' Bride","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["The Magician's Bride","Mahoyome"],"en":"The Ancient Magus' Bride","ja":"魔法使いの嫁"},"synopsis":"Chise Hatori, a 15-year-old Japanese girl, was sold for five million pounds at an auction to a tall masked gentleman. Abandoned at a young age and ridiculed by her peers for her unconventional behavior, she was ready to give herself to any buyer if it meant having a place to go home to. In chains and on her way to an unknown fate, she hears whispers from robed men along her path, gossiping and complaining that such a buyer got his hands on a rare Sleigh Beggy.\n\nIgnoring the murmurs, the mysterious man leads the girl to a study, where he reveals himself to be Elias Ainsworth—a magus. After a brief confrontation and a bit of teleportation magic, the two open their eyes to Elias' picturesque cottage in rural England. Greeted by fairies and surrounded by weird and wonderful beings upon her arrival, these events mark the beginning of Chise's story as the apprentice and supposed bride of the ancient magus.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Chise Hatori, una joven japonesa de 15 años, fue vendida por cinco millones de libras en una subasta a un alto caballero enmascarado. Abandonada a una edad temprana y ridiculizada por sus compañeros por su comportamiento poco convencional, estaba dispuesta a entregarse a cualquier comprador si eso significaba tener un lugar al que volver a casa. Encadenada y en camino hacia un destino desconocido, escucha susurros de hombres vestidos con túnicas a lo largo de su camino, chismeando y quejándose de que tal comprador consiguió un raro Sleigh Beggy.\n\nHaciendo caso omiso de los murmullos, el hombre misterioso lleva a la niña a un estudio, donde se revela como Elias Ainsworth, un mago. Después de una breve confrontación y un poco de magia de teletransportación, los dos abren los ojos a la pintoresca cabaña de Elias en la Inglaterra rural. Saludada por hadas y rodeada de seres extraños y maravillosos a su llegada, estos eventos marcan el comienzo de la historia de Chise como aprendiz y supuesta novia del antiguo mago.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1450,"average_episode_duration":1450,"startDate":"2017-10-08","start_date":"2017-10-08","endDate":"2018-03-25","end_date":"2018-03-25","season":"fall","year":2017,"start_season":{"year":2017,"season":"fall"},"episodes":24,"num_episodes":24,"score":8.05,"mean":8.05,"numListUsers":1035293,"num_list_users":1035293,"genres":[{"id":8,"name":"Drama"},{"id":10,"name":"Fantasy"},{"id":6,"name":"Mythology"},{"id":22,"name":"Romance"},{"id":27,"name":"Shounen"},{"id":82,"name":"Urban Fantasy"}],"studios":[{"id":858,"name":"Wit Studio"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/3/88476.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/3/88476l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/3/88476.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/3/88476l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/3/88476l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"sunday","time":"01:30","day_of_the_week":"sunday","start_time":"01:30","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"sunday 01:30"},"rank":688,"popularity":185,"rating":"pg_13","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":431715,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2017-03-09T01:20:55+00:00","updated_at":"2024-10-06T18:06:26+00:00","source":"manga","background":null,"related_anime":[{"node":{"id":32902,"title":"Mahoutsukai no Yome: Hoshi Matsu Hito","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/4/80587.jpg","large":"http